  "issue_comments": [
    {
      "body": "Thanks @maithilijoshi20, this pins down the hang from #36344. #43444 (merged) fixed it a different way: triton's deterministic extend turned out not to need the alignment at all, so triton now serves any chunk size, and the startup error is kept only for flashinfer and the DSA kpool alignment, where the alignment is real; it also accounts for DP attention splitting the chunk across ranks. Closing as superseded; please reopen if a case is still uncovered.",
      "created_at": "2026-10-10T02:14:22Z",
      "html_url": "https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/pull/36417#issuecomment-6092597553",
